{
 "what": "What git was handed when cmd.exe was given a command line, text by text. `text` is what follows the /c switch. `argv` is every git started from outside git, in order, with its whole argv as git itself wrote it down (the trace2 start event, GIT_TRACE2_EVENT); an empty list: no git ran.",
